## 2. Build URL cuối cùng

```367:403:g:\0.CMS-MAIN-ALL\tam-d\hos\BDS.Master.cs
private string BuildInformationImageUrl(string imageValue, long infoId)
{
    if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(imageValue)) return "";
    string image = imageValue.Trim();

    if (image.StartsWith("http://", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase) || image.StartsWith("https://", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase))
    {
        return image;
    }

    if (image.StartsWith("~/", StringComparison.Ordinal))
    {
        image = image.Substring(1);
    }

    if (image.StartsWith("/"))          // ← Link cũ vào đây: /wp-content/...
    {
        return image;
    }

    if (image.IndexOf('/') >= 0 || image.IndexOf('\\') >= 0)
    {
        return "/" + image.TrimStart('/', '\\');
    }

    if (infoId <= 0)
    {
        return "/" + image.TrimStart('/');
    }

    string sub = "Information" + ("000000" + infoId.ToString()).Substring(("000000" + infoId.ToString()).Length - 6, 6);
    string relPath = WebGlobal.InformationThumbDirectory.TrimStart('/') + "/" + sub + "/" + image;
    return "/" + relPath.TrimStart('/');  // ← Link mới xuống đây: ghép /Media/Images/Information/InformationXXXXXX/file.webp
}
```

---

## Tóm tắt luồng

| Bước | Link cũ (`/wp-content/...`) | Link mới (`file.webp`) |
|------|---------------------------|----------------------|
| 1. Đọc DB | `GetFirstNonEmptyValue` → `ThumbImage` = `/wp-content/...` | `GetFirstNonEmptyValue` → `ThumbImage` = `file.webp` |
| 2. `BuildUrl` | `StartsWith("/")` → return ngay | Xuống tận cùng, ghép theo `infoId` |
| 3. Kết quả | `https://domain/wp-content/...` ✅ | `https://domain/Media/Images/Information/.../file.webp` ✅ |
